      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: is there a way to have it not do that? its making it nearly impossible to use it how I'd like, maybe have a toggle on the component, it just wont do for my usecase, furthermore I tried resetting my playspace but its still too high, does it use my heads distance from the ground as well? if so this is completely unusable, I dont see how this is functionally useful to anyone any where, I would really like to be able to lock my view to the camera with no exception, otherwise there goes yet another avatar I cant make",
